{"sourceUrl":"https://physics.hit.edu.cn/2025/0711/c12332a373453/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:59:55.604822+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://physics.hit.edu.cn/2025/0711/c12332a373453/page.htm","html":"<div><p></p><p><span><span><span>诚挚欢迎全国各高校的优秀应届本科毕业生通过推荐免试方式来我院攻读硕士（博士）学位研究生。具体安排如下：</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><strong>1</strong></span></span></span><span><span><span><strong>、基本修业年限</strong></span></span></span></span></p><p><a href=\"https://physics.hit.edu.cn/2025/0711/c12332a373453/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span><span><span>我院硕士研究生基本修业年限</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>3</span></span></span><span><span><span>年，直博生基本修业年限</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>5</span></span></span><span><span><span>年。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><strong>2</strong></span></span></span><span><span><span><strong>、申请条件</strong></span></span></span></span></p><p><a href=\"https://physics.hit.edu.cn/2025/0711/c12332a373453/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span><span><span>（</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span><span>）在满足我校接收推免生的相关要求基础上，毕业专业应为：物理学、应用物理学、核物理、光电信息科学与技术、光电信息科学与技术（光学工程方向）、光电信息科学与技术（系统方向）、材料物理、材料科学与工程、电子信息科学与技术、电子信息工程、电磁场与天线技术、测控技术与仪器等等相关专业。</span></span></span></span></p><p><a href=\"https://physics.hit.edu.cn/2025/0711/c12332a373453/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span><span><span>（</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span><span><span><span>）所有推免生均需参加我院接收专业方向的面试。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><strong>3</strong></span></span></span><span><span><span><strong>、审核流程</strong></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span><span>）审核时间：我院将于</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>2025</span></span></span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>10</span></span></span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>-9</span></span></span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>10</span></span></span><span><span><span>日开通“推免生信息采集系统”接受可取得推免资格的校内外推免生报名。申请人在完成信息采集后，学院将分三批进行集中审核。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span><span><span><span>）通知形式：学院将通过“信息采集系统”、邮件或短信等形式分批次通知学生。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>我院各专业面试将根据报名人数集中分三批次进行（具体时间另行通知）：</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>第一批：</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>2025</span></span></span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>20</span></span></span><span><span><span>日之前</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>第二批：</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>2025</span></span></span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>8</span></span></span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>31</span></span></span><span><span><span>日之前</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>第三批：</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>2025</span></span></span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>15</span></span></span><span><span><span>日之前</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>3</span></span></span><span><span><span>）按博士招生要求，报考直博生的考生需提交两封专家（正高级职称）推荐信。推荐信下载链接</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>http://yzb.hit.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/20/8d/41fe34e646ebafe4f85fa3bf0dfb/58f7500e-03b9-4045-9893-a1d7df204774.doc</span></span></span><span><span><span>）两封。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><strong>4</strong></span></span></span><span><span><span><strong>、考核安排</strong></span></span></span></span></p><p><a href=\"https://physics.hit.edu.cn/2025/0711/c12332a373453/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span><span><span>（</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span><span>）考核时间与方式（以各专业通知或邮件通知为准）。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span><span><span><span>）考核所需其他材料与提供方式（与学校相同）。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><strong>5</strong></span></span></span><span><span><span><strong>、其他</strong></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span><span>）所有考生（包括本校应届本科毕业生）均须通过“推免生信息采集系统”进行报名。学院接收计划完成后，将不再接收未在系统中报名的考生。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span><span><span><span>）全国推免服务系统开通后，将根据接收计划、报名情况等依照考核结果从高到低顺序确定录取名单。取得所在学校推免生资格且报考我院的上述校内外推免生，在规定时间内，登陆全国推免服务系统完成网上录取确认。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>（3）网上申请需上传如下材料</span><span><span>jpg</span><span>或</span></span><span><span>PDF</span><span>文件，如附件较大导致无法上传，请直接将附件资料发至邮箱</span></span><span><span>1293367694@qq.com</span></span><span><span><span>，附件文件命名格式：姓名－推免生</span><span>－毕业院校。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><strong>6</strong></span></span></span><span><span><span><strong>、联系方式</strong></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>学院联系人：赵老师   </span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>联系电话：</span></span></span><span><span><span>0451-86414109</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>其他未尽事宜按学校相关文件及规定执行。</span></span></span></p><p><span>                              <span><span><span>哈尔滨工业大学物理学院</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>2025</span></span></span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>10</span></span></span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span></p><p><br/><br/></p><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"f07c32b3cb55c0b9fc78c984b5af75e48da97b770169c333e951d5dedf0c9c18","textLength":1020,"sourceSha256":"bdae87187c99e311aafb72ffda60d829572430fd02de99c33eaed0e12e66fb1e","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-ba2c8e534edbfa189a50","title":"2025年哈尔滨工业大学物理学院2026年接收优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:59:55.604822+00:00"}
